stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observing
    Observing --> BlockedObservation: window / samples insufficient
    Observing --> MetricsChecked: window_complete
    MetricsChecked --> BlockedMetrics: threshold exceeded
    MetricsChecked --> PolicyChecked: metrics_passed
    PolicyChecked --> BlockedPolicy: cohort / step invalid
    PolicyChecked --> ApprovalChecked: step_allowed
    ApprovalChecked --> BlockedApproval: missing / expired / drifted
    ApprovalChecked --> HandoffChecked: approval_bound
    HandoffChecked --> BlockedHandoff: owner / decision / idempotency missing
    HandoffChecked --> PromotionReady: handoff_ready
    PromotionReady --> [*]
